17:["$","aside",null,{"className":"article-sidebar","children":[["$","nav",null,{"aria-label":"In this article","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":"IN THIS ARTICLE"}],[["$","a","start-with-you",{"href":"#start-with-you","children":"Start with what you want from the visit"}],["$","a","questions",{"href":"#questions","children":"Ask a few questions before you book"}],["$","a","simple-routine",{"href":"#simple-routine","children":"Keep everyday cleansing gentle"}],["$","a","plan-your-visit",{"href":"#plan-your-visit","children":"Make a little space for your appointment"}]]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"sidebar-booking","children":[["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","children":"✳"}],["$","h2",null,{"children":["Your moment",["$","br",null,{}],"is waiting."]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Facials, body care and time to unwind in Hamilton."}],["$","a",null,{"className":"text-link","href":"/slimmer-you-site/#booking","children":["Plan your visit ",["$","$Lb",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$3:1:props:children:props:children:props:children:props:children:props:fallback:0:1:props:children:1:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-up-right","size":16}]]}]]}]]}]
18:["$","article",null,{"className":"article-body","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"article-intro","children":"A first facial can feel like a lovely idea and a small unknown at the same time. What should you book? Do you need to arrive without makeup? How much time should you leave? A short conversation before your visit can turn those questions into a more comfortable experience."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-takeaway","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":"THE LITTLE TAKEAWAY"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Start with your skin-care goals, ask what the appointment includes, and confirm the details before you visit."}]]}],[["$","section","start-with-you",{"id":"start-with-you","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Start with what you want from the visit"}],[["$","p","You do not need to know the name of a particular facial to begin. You might want a relaxing appointment, a chance to talk about your routine, or help choosing a skin-care service. Describe that in everyday language when you contact the spa.",{"children":"You do not need to know the name of a particular facial to begin. You might want a relaxing appointment, a chance to talk about your routine, or help choosing a skin-care service. Describe that in everyday language when you contact the spa."}],["$","p","Try writing down one or two priorities rather than arriving with a long list of products you want to try. “I’m new to facials and would like to understand my options” is a perfectly useful starting point. At Slimmer You & Pamper Spa, the “Help me choose” booking option lets you request that conversation.",{"children":"Try writing down one or two priorities rather than arriving with a long list of products you want to try. “I’m new to facials and would like to understand my options” is a perfectly useful starting point. At Slimmer You & Pamper Spa, the “Help me choose” booking option lets you request that conversation."}]],"$undefined","$undefined"]}],["$","section","questions",{"id":"questions","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Ask a few questions before you book"}],[["$","p","Facials are not all the same. Ask which steps are included in the proposed service, how long to allow, and what it costs. Do not assume that extraction, exfoliation or a particular device is part of every appointment.",{"children":"Facials are not all the same. Ask which steps are included in the proposed service, how long to allow, and what it costs. Do not assume that extraction, exfoliation or a particular device is part of every appointment."}],["$","p","If you have a skin condition, a recent procedure, allergies or products prescribed by a clinician, discuss those privately with the provider before treatment. Ask your clinician if you are unsure whether a service is appropriate. The online request form is for scheduling; it is not the place to leave medical details.",{"children":"If you have a skin condition, a recent procedure, allergies or products prescribed by a clinician, discuss those privately with the provider before treatment. Ask your clinician if you are unsure whether a service is appropriate. The online request form is for scheduling; it is not the place to leave medical details."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li","What is included in this facial?",{"children":"What is included in this facial?"}],["$","li","How long should I allow for the appointment?",{"children":"How long should I allow for the appointment?"}],["$","li","Should I arrive without makeup?",{"children":"Should I arrive without makeup?"}],"$L1b"]}],"$undefined"]}],"$L1c","$L1d"],"$L1e"]}]
