1c:["$","section","simple-routine",{"id":"simple-routine","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Keep everyday cleansing gentle"}],[["$","p","A complicated new routine is not a prerequisite for visiting a spa. The American Academy of Dermatology recommends a gentle, non-abrasive cleanser, lukewarm water and using your fingertips rather than scrubbing. This is general everyday skin-care guidance, not a replacement for the aftercare instructions for a particular treatment.",{"children":"A complicated new routine is not a prerequisite for visiting a spa. The American Academy of Dermatology recommends a gentle, non-abrasive cleanser, lukewarm water and using your fingertips rather than scrubbing. This is general everyday skin-care guidance, not a replacement for the aftercare instructions for a particular treatment."}],["$","p","Ask the provider what to use or avoid around your appointment. Do not stop prescribed skin treatments based on a general blog post; ask the clinician who prescribed them.",{"children":"Ask the provider what to use or avoid around your appointment. Do not stop prescribed skin treatments based on a general blog post; ask the clinician who prescribed them."}]],"$undefined",["$","p",null,{"className":"article-source","children":["Further reading: ",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://www.aad.org/public/everyday-care/skin-care-basics/care/face-washing-101","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":["American Academy of Dermatology: Face washing 101"," ↗"]}]]}]]}]
1d:["$","section","plan-your-visit",{"id":"plan-your-visit","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Make a little space for your appointment"}],[["$","p","Slimmer You & Pamper Spa is at 609 Upper Wellington Street in Hamilton. Plan your journey using the directions link and confirm the appointment before setting off. If you are arranging a facial around a special occasion, ask how far ahead to schedule that specific service rather than assuming the day of the event is best.",{"children":"Slimmer You & Pamper Spa is at 609 Upper Wellington Street in Hamilton. Plan your journey using the directions link and confirm the appointment before setting off. If you are arranging a facial around a special occasion, ask how far ahead to schedule that specific service rather than assuming the day of the event is best."}],["$","p","The calendar lets you request a preferred date and time without paying online. Your request is saved as pending, so call 365-833-0170 to confirm the service, duration and price. Once those details are settled, you can focus on the reason you booked: a little time for yourself.",{"children":"The calendar lets you request a preferred date and time without paying online. Your request is saved as pending, so call 365-833-0170 to confirm the service, duration and price. Once those details are settled, you can focus on the reason you booked: a little time for yourself."}]],"$undefined","$undefined"]}]
